# WHAT VERCEL MUST NOT UPLOAD.
#
# Git worktrees live INSIDE HYTEK repos, and a CLI deploy (`vercel --prod`)
# uploads the working directory rather than what git tracks. Measured 10/09/2026:
# hytek-purchasing shipped 55,140 files for a 203-file app and its Lambda ran out
# of file descriptors on production — `EMFILE: too many open files` opening its
# own page bundle. This repo is nearly clean today; the guard is here so it stays
# that way the first time a session opens a worktree in it.
#
# GitHub-triggered deploys only see tracked files and were never affected. This
# closes the CLI path.

.worktrees
.claude
node_modules
.next
.git
*.log
